{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "878d027f1533c2aa20473446a1f531af8cfe599c7cbbf839e6e244cc1dd6d9f5", "ja": "奈緒、ブログ読ませてもらったぞ。\n奈緒らしい内容で、なかなか面白かったよ。", "zh": "奈绪，我看到你的部落格了。\n很有奈绪的风格，非常有趣喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "df811e345e9299fe568b33c9200e3ec05bbd8bced44c30d3a52ee6aa6c57292b", "ja": "え、{$P$}さんが？\nも～、読むなら読むって、先に言うといてくださいよ！", "zh": "什么？{$P$}先生看过了？\n真是的～看之前要先跟我说一声啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c06ef06daab5631fa8adecaf8ec37e8b7074b89e7d9edfd698b056ba64b69ba9", "ja": "え？　ダメだったのか？", "zh": "咦？我不能直接看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "0c539bfddb067cb6d1f8891d2c4d6f5afe9d51b2c1bbb63ff1cce3a003f48923", "ja": "ダメやないですけど。\nただ、アレはファンのみんなに向けて書いたから……。", "zh": "也不是不行啦。\n只是，部落格是写给粉丝看的啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "e00aff9abfb79f8a61a49a84899e667ff15a74c830aa41cf476419d9d8f94254", "ja": "ほら、「私メッチャかわいい」とか書いてたやろ？\nあれはみんなにツッコんで欲しかったからで～。", "zh": "你想想，里面都写些「我真是超可爱」之类的吼？\n用意是希望大家吐槽我呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "b92cf85f6053ef5e1a250816c365c5cc8e8cbabfda936bfa0a6dcd7c6fb381cd", "ja": "ついでに、私のコト見に来てくれるみんなに、\n自信ないとか思われたくなかっただけやからな？", "zh": "顺便让部落格的读者们不要觉得我是个没自信的人，\n只是这样而已啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0fd01694eda8097954c4dcc8d9eb3c80205717cf074295856d2a7ff730caa688", "ja": "もちろん、わかってるよ。それに心配しなくても、\n奈緒はちゃんとかわいいから大丈夫だ。", "zh": "这些我当然知道。而且奈绪用不着担心，\n你真的很可爱，没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "bec8ce0a2449de6922cd74621b511e0eff8aaa3336ef527fdc5d71d6862b3714", "ja": "へ……えぇぇっ！？", "zh": "咦……咦咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "fd7807f97338b7093d487cd48e738118e0ba31b59fa93af4f994d0199c590ca2", "ja": "も、もぉ、わかってへんなぁ！\nほめるなら、ちゃんとボケてからにしてくださいよ！", "zh": "真、真是的！你根本就不懂啦！\n要夸奖我之前，请先装傻好吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1009_p", "source_sha256": "cb7644c69c298d9733bb67995d57715d72ac969b94e220f7f1136ca31a4346ac", "ja": "え、ボケてからほめるのか？　難しいな、ええと……\n奈緒はかわいいぞ！　俺と同じくらいかわいい！", "zh": "呃？先装傻再夸奖吗？好难喔，我想想……\n奈绪很可爱喔！就跟我一样可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "cd6338a436bea5a07bc5e0d06e57d932306547efc5642f1a911781590431e24d", "ja": "せやな！　{$P$}さんも、アイドル\nみたいにかわいいからな～……ってなんでやねーん！", "zh": "就是说吼！{$P$}先生也跟\n偶像一样可爱耶……不对！搞什么呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "d4921536412b5754570132c4a4d629c489e6161d954652fb4a7ef4f7b4072faf", "ja": "ふぅ……ナイス、{$P$}さん！\n今のは、なかなかええボケやったと思うわ。", "zh": "呼……太赞了，{$P$}先生！\n刚才那个装傻我觉得很不错喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1ed4858bd47da0bfd4817573727189048689d2057dce8a7f7cfb40a98cfe6447", "ja": "そ、そうか……よかったよ。\nありがとう。", "zh": "是、是吗……太好了。\n谢谢夸奖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "7925068477914ac9e2d3a7096c7c98d52661916f744f70779906da4f6908452e", "ja": "マジメか！　そこはボケたおしてくれんと。\nなんや、私の方が恥ずかしいやんか～！", "zh": "你在正经什么啦！？要装傻到底才对吼。\n这样反而让我害羞起来了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e54da3b1d61767b087316cace61b5bc1f1da43caebb8fb7a150bd35b5dfc6528", "ja": "そ、そうなのか？　すまない……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "91a68a10bee3e03116646f25c6dd023ccbe0fffb32a42df4c57120d1d6b82370", "ja": "だからマジメか！　って、もうええわ。\nありがとうございましたー♪", "zh": "你还继续搞正经！真是的，够了啦。\n谢谢大家观赏～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "bf2b2a53ef05e331ba9ecd50c5af2ddaae1642864b3c0a63ec86c17d7299d04f", "ja": "ふう……。えへへ、ほんまにちょっと自信ついたし。\nありがとうな、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "呼……嘿嘿，这下我真的有点自信啦。\n谢啦，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5baa39af32e7f1c055ee963010a7c3840e55f938cd0d49cd6e1c892eed624732", "ja": "えっ。今のでか？", "zh": "什么？刚才那样就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0054_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "feed294457d3743ef945241678dd0493aba9f3bf514685bb4170c25ebe121daa", "ja": "うんっ。ちゃんと伝わってきましたから♪", "zh": "是呀，因为你的诚意我都感受到啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
